                        "sense_id": "94696501-4688-390b-bb45-1b1dd49d6291",
                        "entry_id": "2ae8f1db-3ae8-379c-ae18-46b340c89524",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Significantly below the actual cost or value."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ac5882e-1b87-4c23-a3b2-1ad01633386f",
                                "sense_id": "94696501-4688-390b-bb45-1b1dd49d6291",
                                "text": "In April, NASA selected SpaceX to build the lunar lander for the Artemis program, thanks in part to a lowball $2.9 billion bid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3cbc876-d4ad-426a-a627-1231316eac09",
                                "sense_id": "94696501-4688-390b-bb45-1b1dd49d6291",
                                "text": "At the meeting last Wednesday during which these changes were announced, the interim head of the NEH also estimated that each of the 250 statues would cost $100,000 to $200,000, bringing the total cost as high as $50 million. And this may have been a lowball figure."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
